{"page":212,"width":1802,"height":2934,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"266","words":[{"text":"266","x":189,"y":173,"width":65,"height":32}]},{"text":"Chapter 5 CPU 스케줄링","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":334,"y":175,"width":133,"height":31},{"text":"5","x":483,"y":174,"width":24,"height":25},{"text":"CPU","x":541,"y":175,"width":59,"height":26},{"text":"스케줄링","x":611,"y":174,"width":98,"height":28}]},{"text":"그러한 스케줄러를 가지고 있지 않다. 오히려 UMS 위에 구축된 프로그래밍 언어 라의","words":[{"text":"그러한","x":335,"y":318,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"스케줄러를","x":456,"y":318,"width":178,"height":42},{"text":"가지고","x":651,"y":318,"width":104,"height":42},{"text":"있지","x":772,"y":318,"width":63,"height":42},{"text":"않다.","x":856,"y":319,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"오히려","x":952,"y":321,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"UMS","x":1072,"y":324,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"위에","x":1182,"y":321,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"구축된","x":1269,"y":320,"width":109,"height":43},{"text":"프로그래밍","x":1395,"y":320,"width":187,"height":43},{"text":"언어","x":1605,"y":321,"width":63,"height":44},{"text":"라의","x":1686,"y":329,"width":51,"height":50}]},{"text":"브러리들을 이용하여 스게줄러를 만들 수 있다. 예를 들어, Micmsoft는 태스크 기반 병","words":[{"text":"브러리들을","x":334,"y":386,"width":179,"height":41},{"text":"이용하여","x":527,"y":387,"width":135,"height":42},{"text":"스게줄러를","x":680,"y":386,"width":177,"height":43},{"text":"만들","x":870,"y":387,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":953,"y":388,"width":36,"height":41},{"text":"있다.","x":1004,"y":388,"width":75,"height":41},{"text":"예를","x":1097,"y":388,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"들어,","x":1181,"y":389,"width":81,"height":42},{"text":"Micmsoft는","x":1277,"y":390,"width":223,"height":39},{"text":"태스크","x":1516,"y":389,"width":111,"height":42},{"text":"기반","x":1642,"y":392,"width":62,"height":43},{"text":"병","x":1715,"y":405,"width":23,"height":40}]},{"text":"별성(4.2절)을 제공하기 위해 설계된 C++를 위한 병행 프로그래밍 프레임워크인 c이1.","words":[{"text":"별성(4.2절)을","x":336,"y":455,"width":219,"height":44},{"text":"제공하기","x":570,"y":456,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"위해","x":725,"y":455,"width":66,"height":41},{"text":"설계된","x":809,"y":455,"width":103,"height":41},{"text":"C++를","x":926,"y":457,"width":116,"height":39},{"text":"위한","x":1057,"y":456,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"병행","x":1143,"y":456,"width":67,"height":41},{"text":"프로그래밍","x":1227,"y":456,"width":181,"height":42},{"text":"프레임워크인","x":1428,"y":458,"width":225,"height":43},{"text":"c이1.","x":1668,"y":466,"width":72,"height":40}]},{"text":"currency Runtime (ConRT)를 제공한다. ConRT는 프로그램을 분해하여 처리기 코","words":[{"text":"currency","x":332,"y":537,"width":162,"height":33},{"text":"Runtime","x":508,"y":528,"width":160,"height":32},{"text":"(ConRT)를","x":683,"y":526,"width":186,"height":42},{"text":"제공한다.","x":885,"y":524,"width":147,"height":41},{"text":"ConRT는","x":1049,"y":526,"width":163,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램을","x":1227,"y":525,"width":188,"height":41},{"text":"분해하여","x":1430,"y":527,"width":151,"height":43},{"text":"처리기","x":1604,"y":528,"width":94,"height":43},{"text":"코","x":1713,"y":541,"width":26,"height":32}]},{"text":"어에서 스케줄 될 수 있는 태스크를 분해히는 설비와 함께 스케줄러를 제공한다.","words":[{"text":"어에서","x":334,"y":592,"width":101,"height":42},{"text":"스케줄","x":453,"y":592,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"될","x":573,"y":592,"width":32,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":618,"y":593,"width":37,"height":40},{"text":"있는","x":670,"y":593,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"태스크를","x":750,"y":592,"width":140,"height":41},{"text":"분해히는","x":902,"y":592,"width":141,"height":42},{"text":"설비와","x":1057,"y":592,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"함께","x":1175,"y":592,"width":70,"height":43},{"text":"스케줄러를","x":1261,"y":594,"width":189,"height":41},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1465,"y":595,"width":159,"height":44}]},{"text":"Windows는 또한 해당 스레드에 가장 적합한 처리 코어에 스레드가 스케줄 되도","words":[{"text":"Windows는","x":398,"y":663,"width":210,"height":39},{"text":"또한","x":624,"y":661,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"해당","x":712,"y":661,"width":71,"height":42},{"